# Sugar Coat on Bot2's Birds of Paradise (CR 613.1d, 613.1e, 613.1f): it stops being a green Bird creature and is a colorless Food artifact, losing
# its flying and its mana ability. On turn 4 Bot2 pays {2} from two Forests and taps and sacrifices it: the one ability it has gains Bot2
# 3 life, and no mana is added to the pool; Sugar Coat, left enchanting nothing, goes to Bot1's graveyard.

